{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/e9d8df40029ecfa93b2169f27fee7b04.avif?t=1768851591\" width=611 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.poster.avif?t=1768851591\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.webm?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.mp4?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through randomized levels filled with deadly enemies, hazards, and over-the-top violence. Kick doors in, shred enemies, and don\u2019t stop moving. It\u2019s pure aggression! No brakes, no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/c91746918fdd1e505e99bc9ebe0a7d78.avif?t=1768851591\" width=611 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/ba1ead7e9e2806c4cda2d5082ee870be.poster.avif?t=1768851591\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/ba1ead7e9e2806c4cda2d5082ee870be.webm?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/ba1ead7e9e2806c4cda2d5082ee870be.mp4?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized environments, upgrades and enemies, each run delivers a whole new challenge. Your ability to adapt on the fly is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/3a08b7395e07e7e3a2c3c4dd8aecce09.avif?t=1768851591\" width=611 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/63858a8bdd0c786b52cec7e6ab00c4da.poster.avif?t=1768851591\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/63858a8bdd0c786b52cec7e6ab00c4da.webm?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/63858a8bdd0c786b52cec7e6ab00c4da.mp4?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip weapons from enemies, hurl pipes and bricks, and toss guns when they\u2019re dry. If it hurts, it\u2019s a weapon. use it and keep moving.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819020?t=1768851591","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819020?t=1768851591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/39c043947d5c2369523e260b68c21692b724e313/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768851591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/39c043947d5c2369523e260b68c21692b724e313/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768851591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains graphic violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/e9d8df40029ecfa93b2169f27fee7b04.avif?t=1768851591\" width=611 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.poster.avif?t=1768851591\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.webm?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/218bd6a6e4427c70db7e4c8158f405a7.mp4?t=1768851591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through randomized levels filled with deadly enemies, hazards, and over-the-top violence. Kick doors in, shred enemies, and don\u2019t stop moving. It\u2019s pure aggression! No brakes, no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/c91746918fdd1e505e99bc9ebe0a7d78.avif?t=1768851591\" width=611 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819020/extras/ba1ead7e9e2806c4cda2d5082ee870be.poster.avif?t=1768851591\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta